# Faces

Same git remote. **Different checkouts.** Do not treat laptop, Slack, and Cloud as one tree.

| Face | Typical path | Use |
|------|--------------|-----|
| Laptop IDE | the clone you opened | Edit + push git. Not the VPS tree. |
| Slack + tick | `cursor-agent` `~/slack-workspace/<hub>` | Slack + scheduled jobs |
| Cloud worker | `cursor-agent` `~/cursor-workspace/<hub>` | Cursor Cloud / web / phone |

Agents run as `cursor-agent` (no sudo). The admin user owns Docker / vault / host apt.

Git: stay on the default branch unless the operator asks for a branch. `git pull --ff-only` before scheduled work.
